## 8. Интеграция с инфраструктурой

### 8.1. docker-compose (фрагмент)

```yaml
psychometry-service:
  build: .
  container_name: pa-psychometry
  command: ["uvicorn", "src.main:app", "--host", "0.0.0.0", "--port", "8000"]
  environment:
    DATABASE_URL: postgresql://...
    ASTRO_SERVICE_URL: http://astro-service:8000
    ASTRO_FALLBACK_MODE: "true"
    LAKE_ENDPOINT: minio:9000
    MMPI_INTERVAL_DAYS: 90
    IAT_INTERVAL_DAYS: 30
  ports:
    - "127.0.0.1:8002:8000"
  depends_on:
    postgres:
      condition: service_healthy
    minio:
      condition: service_healthy
  # НЕТ depends_on astro-service (автономность)
  healthcheck:
    test: ["CMD", "curl", "-f", "http://localhost:8000/health"]
    interval: 30s
    timeout: 10s
    retries: 3
  restart: unless-stopped

psychometry-outbox-worker:
  build: .
  command: ["python", "-m", "src.workers.outbox_worker"]
  environment:
    DATABASE_URL: postgresql://...
    ASTRO_SERVICE_URL: http://astro-service:8000
  depends_on:
    postgres:
      condition: service_healthy
  # НЕТ depends_on astro-service
  restart: unless-stopped
```

### 8.2. Метрики и аудит (fire-and-forget)

Метрики и аудит не блокируют HTTP-ответ. Реализуются через `asyncio.create_task()` или фоновый мини-worker. При ошибке записи — лог warning, не exception.

